    "body": "Sorry, in the meeting just now, I misunderstood due to a quick scan of the issue. This issue is **just about the `<select>` control**, right? The `<button>` element seems to respect `padding` regardless of `appearance` on Chromium, Gecko, WebKit, at least for me on a Mac.\r\n\r\nIs that right?\r\n\r\nChrome:\r\n<img width=\"163\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2022-12-08 at 9 37 46 AM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29559695/206524003-5ff5cc61-7032-4798-9974-1fc2daf68e43.png\">\r\n\r\nSafari:\r\n<img width=\"149\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2022-12-08 at 9 38 11 AM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29559695/206524080-c1769cbb-8765-4615-bbd1-8307266fa7a6.png\">\r\n\r\nFirefox:\r\n<img width=\"171\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2022-12-08 at 9 38 33 AM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/29559695/206524157-8d31abd7-11d7-4506-ac93-f68fd0d5c3f5.png\">\r\n\r\n",
