    "updated_at": "2022-12-16T03:45:52Z",
    "body": "I would like to note that WebKit cannot truly support padding on \"natively styled\" `<select>`. Our control is painted using AppKit's `NSPopupButtonCell` – which draws at 4 fixed sizes, and does not allow us to customize padding. For the same reason, WebKit does not support arbitrary font sizes on \"natively styled\" `<select>`.\r\n\r\nIf WebKit were to \"respect\" padding for this form of `<select>`, the rendered appearance would essentially be as if the `<select>` were wrapped in a `<span>` with the specified padding.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
