    "body": "In WebKit `<input type=button value=Foo>` also doesn't respect `padding`. I think the difference is the internal `appearance` is `push-button` vs for `<button>` it is `square-button`. (The appearance values aren't controllable from author CSS since the keywords map to `auto`.)\r\n\r\nhttp://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/11113",
