    "body": "> In WebKit `<input type=button value=Foo>` also doesn't respect `padding`. I think the difference is the internal `appearance` is `push-button` vs for `<button>` it is `square-button`. (The appearance values aren't controllable from author CSS since the keywords map to `auto`.)\r\n> \r\n> http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/11113\r\n\r\nWe do want to fix that: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=238803 since it affects our ability to render multi-line `<input type=button>` (`push-button` cannot be rendered with multiple lines, platform limitation). ",
